🤖 Machine Learning

The wake-word model uses:

MFCC audio features
13 MFCC coefficients
151 time frames
Lightweight CNN architecture
Two output classes:
ASTHRA
UNKNOWN / NOISE

The trained model is converted to TensorFlow Lite and INT8 quantized for embedded deployment.

Model Size
Model	Size
Float TFLite	~231.54 KB
INT8 TFLite	~63.11 KB
🎙️ Dataset

The project uses audio recorded through the same INMP441 MEMS microphone and ESP32 audio path used by the final device.

Dataset categories:

ASTHRA
UNKNOWN
NOISE

A dedicated ESP32 + Python recording system is included in the repository.

🖥️ Software
Arduino IDE
ESP32 Arduino Core
TensorFlow / TensorFlow Lite
TensorFlow Lite Micro
Python
Librosa
NumPy
SciPy
